* This driver requires an x86-based Macintosh computer with an Infineon TPM.

* To compile this driver, you must have Apple's Xcode package installed. You
  can either open the project in Xcode and use the GUI to build it, or you
  can use the xcodebuild command-line program to do so. In a pinch:

  $ cd /path/to/osxbook-tpm-driver-1.0.0/
  $ xcodebuild -configuration Release
  ...
  $ cp -pr build/Release/OSXBookTPM.kext /tmp
  $ sudo chown -R root:wheel /tmp/OSXBookTPM.kext
  $ sudo kextload -v /tmp/OSXBookTPM.kext

* See http://osxbook.com/book/bonus/chapter10/tpm/ for details.

Amit Singh <http://osxbook.com>
